    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just... exhausting. feeling like a relic. like every season that passes just gets a little more foreign, a little more cold. i look at what's ahead and i don't see anything i want to participate in. it's like i've reached the natural end of my chapter and the rest of the book is just gibberish to me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
